DREAM-RAW writes the DC-RAW menu to your GDEMU SD card and renames track
files of some game images. It backs up what was on the menu slot first, and
restoring puts back the original menu and the original names of any track
files it renamed, but you use it at your own risk. DREAM-RAW is not affiliated
with RetroAchievements, the makers of GDEMU or Sega.
